<div class="text-center page-content">
    <img class="myimage" src="~/img/myimage.jpeg" alt="My Image" width="250" height="300">
    <h1 class="shadow-text body-text">About</h1>
    <div class="body-text">
        <p>Ibrahim Afolabi is a designer and developer with a passion for building complete, functional digital products from concept to deployment. Originally from Nigeria, he holds a B.Sc. in Mathematics from the Federal University of Agriculture, Abeokuta, and brings a strong analytical foundation to everything he builds. </p>
        <p>Over the past year he has designed and shipped five live platforms - including an AI-powered customer support tool, a settlement super-app for Calgary newcomers, a shortlet booking platform, a real-estate listing site, and a full e-commerce store — each built end to end using HTML, CSS, JavaScript, Angular, Firebase, and the Anthropic Claude API.</p>
        <p> Beyond development, Ibrahim has a background spanning financial administration, investment analytics, IT support, and property management, giving him a well-rounded perspective on real-world problem solving.</p>
        <p>He is currently pursuing a Software Development Diploma at Bow Valley College in Calgary, where he continues to grow his technical foundation while actively taking on new projects and opportunities.</p>
    </div>
</div>
